{"availability":"available","full":"NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG","name":"VidyaRAG","description":"Agentic, self-correcting RAG study assistant over CC BY OpenStax textbooks - cross-encoder reranking, claim-level groundedness checks, page-level citations, and explicit abstention. Every component ablated against a frozen baseline.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-07T07:39:44Z","updated":"2026-09-24T10:53:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/nehabharti0802/VidyaRAG","topics":["fastapi","gemini","gradio","llm","llm-evaluation","prompt-injection","python","qdrant","rag","ragas","retrieval-augmented-generation","vector-search"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/nehabharti0802/VidyaRAG","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:04.017Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:04.017Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:04.017Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.316Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:49:04.017Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A study assistant that checks its own work — and admits when the textbook doesn't have the answer.","Agentic, self-correcting RAG over open-license OpenStax biology textbooks, with page-level citations, a claim-level groundedness check, and an evaluation harness that measures whether any of it actually helped.","Status: deployed and live. Ingestion, baseline, evaluation harness, retrieval ablations, the corrective self-check, injection guardrails, Docker, CI, and the hosted demo — see Live demo. No number here appears before it has been measured, and docs/EVALUATION.md lists what failed."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6c0139da789c0261942e6dc5ffbad64d198969d7ef6323613546a61f1a891d0b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.471Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.471Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A study assistant that checks its own work — and admits when the textbook doesn't have the answer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Ingestion runs separately and needs no API key — PDFs are fetched and checksummed, chunked with the embedding model's own tokeniser, embedded locally on CPU, and written to an on-disk Qdrant index that ships with the demo.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"They cost latency only when there is something to catch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"It runs the same dense-then-rerank path as /v1/query and stops before the LLM, so it needs no Gemini key and costs nothing per call — which also makes it the endpoint to reach for when debugging whether a bad answer was a retrieval failure or a generation one.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6c0139da789c0261942e6dc5ffbad64d198969d7ef6323613546a61f1a891d0b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.471Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-24T10:53:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NehaBharti08/VidyaRAG/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.472Z","hash":"6c0139da789c0261942e6dc5ffbad64d198969d7ef6323613546a61f1a891d0b","originalBytes":19576,"storedBytes":19576,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:49.316Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"meta